            <ArticleTitle>[ST segment changes in long-term stored ECG].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>33-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The diagnostic value of ST-changes in the ECG in temporary myocardial ischemia is described: the importance of detecting &quot;silent&quot; ischemia is stressed. Methods for long-time-ECG-recordings are frequency- as well as amplitude-modulations.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
